### Create booking manually
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipper": "Acme Exports",
  "consignee": "Northline Imports",
  "originPort": "Shanghai",
  "destinationPort": "Singapore",
  "cargoDescription": "Electronics",
  "containerType": "40HC",
  "etd": "2026-10-15",
  "eta": "2026-10-22",
  "requestorEmail": "ops@company.com",
  "sourceChannel": "manual"
}

### Email intake
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bookings/email-intake
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderEmail": "customer@example.com",
  "subject": "Booking request for Shanghai to Singapore",
  "sourceEmailId": "email-001",
  "shipper": "BluePeak Trading",
  "consignee": "Harbor Goods",
  "originPort": "Busan",
  "destinationPort": "Jakarta",
  "cargoDescription": "Machinery",
  "containerType": "20GP",
  "etd": "2026-10-20",
  "eta": "2026-10-27"
}

### Confirm booking
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/bookings/1/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carrier": "OceanAlliance",
  "voyageNumber": "OA-123"
}

### Get all bookings
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bookings
